OL,3,GNEWSAHospice faces #10m shortfall for
OL,4,Aexpansion plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FA children's hospice has said it is
OL,7,Fshort of about #10m to expand its site.
OL,9,FClaire House wants to extend its campus
OL,10,Fat the former Carmelite monastery in
OL,11,FWest Derby in Liverpool.
OL,13,FBut to complete the expansion plan, it
OL,14,Fneeds public donations, its chief
OL,15,Fexecutive David Pastor said.
OL,17,F"We're taking a bit of a risk here to
OL,18,Fget on with the building and we don't
OL,19,Fnecessarily have all the funds in place
OL,20,Fat the moment," he said.
